1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:02,403
(Amy:)I don't know
what you're talking about.

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:06,206
(Penny:)Fine. I'm calling home,

3
00:00:06,212 --> 00:00:07,812
(Penny:)but when I'm done,
you're calling your mother.

4
00:00:08,414 --> 00:00:10,444
(Amy:)Easy for you to say.

5
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:12,849
(Amy:)You never had to watch
60 Minutes like this.

6
00:00:15,353 --> 00:00:16,523
(Penny:)Hey, Daddy.

7
00:00:16,522 --> 00:00:17,792
(Penny's Dad:)Hey, slugger.

8
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,190
(Penny's Dad:)How's my girl?

9
00:00:19,191 --> 00:00:20,821
(Penny:)Uh, good. Is Mom around?

10
00:00:20,826 --> 00:00:22,926
(Penny's Dad:)Ah, she took your brother out
to celebrate.

11
00:00:22,928 --> 00:00:25,798
(Penny's Dad:)He just got his tenth
one-month sober chip.

12
00:00:26,998 --> 00:00:30,768
(Penny's Dad:)Yeah, she's gonna make him
a little necklace.

13
00:00:30,769 --> 00:00:32,239
(Penny:)Okay, I'll talk to her later.

14
00:00:32,238 --> 00:00:34,068
(Penny:)Uh, Dad, there's something
I need to tell you.

15
00:00:34,706 --> 00:00:37,206
(Penny:)Leonard and I got married.

16
00:00:37,209 --> 00:00:38,379
(Penny's Dad:)You did?

17
00:00:38,377 --> 00:00:39,707
(Penny's Dad:)When?

18
00:00:39,712 --> 00:00:41,382
(Penny:)Last week. I'm sorry,
I should've told you.

19
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,750
(Penny:)It was a spur
of the moment thing.

20
00:00:42,748 --> 00:00:43,978
(Penny:)I feel terrible.

21
00:00:43,983 --> 00:00:45,353
(Penny:)Please don't be
too disappointed.

22
00:00:45,351 --> 00:00:47,551
(Penny's Dad:)Are you happy?

23
00:00:47,553 --> 00:00:48,553
(Howard:)Very.

24
00:00:48,554 --> 00:00:49,854
(Penny:)Leonard is so great.

25
00:00:49,855 --> 00:00:51,685
(Penny's Dad:)Well, then I'm happy for you.

26
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,890
(Penny:)Aw, thank you, Daddy.

27
00:00:53,892 --> 00:00:54,962
(Penny:)That means so much.

28
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,260
(Penny's Dad:)Well, I understand it's hard

29
00:00:56,262 --> 00:00:57,492
(Penny's Dad:)to tell someone something

30
00:00:57,496 --> 00:00:59,426
(Penny's Dad:)if you think
it's gonna upset 'em.

31
00:00:59,431 --> 00:01:00,661
(Penny:)It is.

